      - 德国
  - name: Whatsapp
    icon: https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ftzahao/config/main/assets/LogosWhatsappIcon.png
    type: select
    proxies:
      - 默认
      - 自动选择
      - 手动选择
      - 美国
      - 日本
      - 新加坡
      - 英国
      - 台湾
      - 香港
      - 港澳台
      - 韩国
      - 马来西亚
      - 德国
  - name: 美国
    icon: https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ftzahao/config/main/assets/CircleFlagsUs.png
    type: url-test
    include-all: true
    interval: 120
    tolerance: 50
    lazy: true
    filter: (?i)(美国|美[利联]|🇺🇸|凤凰城|洛杉矶|西雅图|芝加哥|纽约|沪美|(^|[^a-z])(us|usa|united states|america)([^a-z]|$))
  - name: 日本
    icon: https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ftzahao/config/main/assets/CircleFlagsJp.png
    type: url-test
    include-all: true
    interval: 120
    tolerance: 50
    lazy: true
    filter: (?i)(日本|🇯🇵|东京|大阪|日[系本]|(^|[^a-z])(jp|japan|jpn)([^a-z]|$))
  - name: 新加坡
    icon: https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ftzahao/config/main/assets/CircleFlagsSg.png
    type: url-test
    include-all: true
    interval: 120
    tolerance: 50
    lazy: true
    filter: (?i)(新加坡|狮城|🇸🇬|(^|[^a-z])(sg|sgp|singapore)([^a-z]|$))
  - name: 英国
    icon: https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ftzahao/config/main/assets/CircleFlagsUk.png
    type: url-test
    include-all: true
    interval: 120
    tolerance: 50
    lazy: true
    filter: (?i)(英国|伦敦|🇬🇧|(^|[^a-z])(uk|united kingdom)([^a-z]|$))
  - name: 台湾
    icon: https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ftzahao/config/main/assets/CircleFlagsTw.png
    type: url-test
    include-all: true
    interval: 120
    tolerance: 50
    lazy: true
    filter: (?i)(台湾|台北|台中|台南|新北|高雄|🇹🇼|(^|[^a-z])(tw|taiwan)([^a-z]|$))
  - name: 香港
    icon: https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ftzahao/config/main/assets/CircleFlagsHk.png
    type: url-test
    include-all: true
    interval: 120
    tolerance: 50
    lazy: true
    filter: (?i)(香港|🇭🇰|(^|[^a-z])(hk|hong ?kong)([^a-z]|$))
  - name: 港澳台
    icon: https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ftzahao/config/main/assets/CircleFlagsCn.png
    type: url-test
    include-all: true
    interval: 120
    tolerance: 50
    lazy: true
    filter: (?i)(^|\s|\-|\[|\(|\|)(HK|TW|MO|香港|台湾|澳门|台北|台中|新北|彰化|Macau|Hong Kong|Taiwan|HKTW|港台|🇭🇰|🇹🇼|🇲🇴)(\s|\-|$|\]|\)|\|)
  - name: 韩国
    icon: https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ftzahao/config/main/assets/CircleFlagsKr.png
    type: url-test
    include-all: true
    interval: 120
    tolerance: 50
    lazy: true
    filter: (?i)(韩|韓|首尔|首爾|seoul|서울|한국|🇰🇷|(^|[^a-z])(kr|kor|korea)([^a-z]|$))
  - name: 马来西亚
    icon: https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ftzahao/config/main/assets/CircleFlagsMy.png
    type: url-test
    include-all: true
    interval: 120
    tolerance: 50
    lazy: true
    filter: (?i)(马来西亚|馬來西亞|马来(?:西亚)?|馬來(?:西亞)?|Malaysia|Kuala\s*Lumpur|吉隆坡|🇲🇾)
  - name: 德国
    icon: https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ftzahao/config/main/assets/CircleFlagsDe.png
    type: url-test
    include-all: true
    interval: 120
    tolerance: 50
    lazy: true
    filter: (?i)(德国|德國|germany|deutschland|frankfurt|berlin|🇩🇪|(^|[^a-z])de([^a-z]|$))
  - name: 自动选择
    icon: https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ftzahao/config/main/assets/StreamlineStickiesColorCompass1Duo.png
    type: url-test
    include-all: true
    interval: 120
    tolerance: 50
    lazy: true
    filter: (?i)^(?!.*(剩余|有效期|到期|流量|重置|套餐|用量|官网|网址|网站|客服|邮箱|邮件|群组|频道|订阅|机场|购买|会员|工单|公告|预警|跑路|说明|教程|负载|维护|反馈|测速|仪表盘|导航|镜像|天气|时间|Telegram|TG|电报|星云)).*$
  - name: 手动选择
    icon: https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ftzahao/config/main/assets/StreamlineStickiesColorCursorDuo.png
    type: select
    include-all: true
    filter: (?i)^(?!.*(剩余|有效期|到期|流量|重置|套餐|用量|官网|网址|网站|客服|邮箱|邮件|群组|频道|订阅|机场|购买|会员|工单|公告|预警|跑路|说明|教程|负载|维护|反馈|测速|仪表盘|导航|镜像|天气|时间|Telegram|TG|电报|星云)).*$
  - name: 其他信息
    icon: https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ftzahao/config/main/assets/StreamlineStickiesColorOnlineInformationDuo.png
    type: select
    include-all: true
    filter: (?i)(剩余|有效期|到期|流量|重置|套餐|用量|官网|网址|网站|客服|邮箱|邮件|群组|频道|订阅|机场|购买|会员|工单|公告|预警|跑路|说明|教程|负载|维护|反馈|测速|仪表盘|导航|镜像|天气|时间|Telegram|TG|电报|星云)
